<mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;While an approval is running&lt;/b&gt; for create or update the object has is_active = False. An Approval row (ongoing) and one ApprovalTask per level exist; see state-approval-task.drawio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;No workflow configured&lt;/b&gt; (no ApprovalDocument for institution + model + action and no custom logic): the transition completes immediately." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="840" width="520" height="150" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;Inferred – verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;projects.Task and tasks.StandaloneTask override finish_workflow() and also assign the strings “deleted” and “rejected”, which are not in the declared choices. Institution.approval_status uses a different value set (pending / approved / rejected / under_review) for which no assignments were found in code." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="840" width="520" height="150" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
